      <h2 id="openshift-architecture-common-terms_architecture-overview" class="group scroll-mt-20">Glossary of common terms for OpenShift Container Platform architecture<a href="#openshift-architecture-common-terms_architecture-overview" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
